"Prepares the muted microphone while the app is active with a visible window, so native Guest meetings can reuse it for faster unmuting and headset controls. Muted audio is never sent. Uses extra energy. Bluetooth headsets may switch to call audio quality. Preparation stops shortly after the app becomes inactive. Power changes do not interrupt an active meeting." = "在应用处于活跃状态且窗口可见时预先准备静音状态的麦克风，以便原生访客会议直接复用，加快取消静音与耳机按键响应速度。静音期间绝不会发送音频。此功能会消耗额外电量，且蓝牙耳机可能会切换至通话音质。应用转入非活跃状态后不久将停止预备。电源状态变化不会中断正在进行的会议。";
"Low Power Mode prevents automatic microphone and camera preparation. Preparation uses existing permission. Defaults apply to native Guest meetings; explicit microphone choices also apply to supported headset controls in other meetings." = "低电量模式会阻止自动准备麦克风和摄像头。准备工作仅使用已授予的权限。默认设置适用于原生访客会议；明确指定的麦克风选项也适用于其他会议中受支持的耳机控制。";
"Prepares camera information while the app is active. Briefly prepares the camera privately after joining, then stops it. No frames are shared. Uses extra energy and may briefly light the camera indicator. Skipped in Audio only view." = "应用处于活跃状态时预先准备摄像头信息。入会后会私密地短暂预热摄像头并随即停止，不会共享任何画面。会消耗额外电量，并可能短暂点亮摄像头指示灯。在“仅音频”视图下将跳过此步骤。";
